00:58:53.282 --> 00:58:55.619
if I'm hurting my family...


00:58:56.494 --> 00:58:58.371
just tell me.


00:58:59.498 --> 00:59:01.041
I can't tell you...


00:59:01.958 --> 00:59:03.876
because I don't know.


00:59:04.670 --> 00:59:09.048
I had this vision the night
that you didn't get your Gift.


00:59:09.967 --> 00:59:11.552
<i>Abuela worried about the magic.</i>


00:59:11.717 --> 00:59:15.556
<i>So, she begged me to look into the future.
See what it meant.</i>


00:59:17.056 --> 00:59:20.268
<i>And I saw the magic in danger.</i>


00:59:21.143 --> 00:59:24.231
<i>Our house breaking.</i>


00:59:24.398 --> 00:59:28.235
<i>And then, and then, and then, I saw you.</i>


00:59:28.402 --> 00:59:31.989
<i>But the vision was different.
It would change.</i>


00:59:32.155 --> 00:59:35.409
<i>And there was no one answer.
No clear fate.</i>


00:59:35.576 --> 00:59:38.536
<i>Like your future was undecided.</i>


00:59:39.454 --> 00:59:42.016
<i>But I knew how it was gonna look.
I knew what everyone would think...</i>


00:59:42.039 --> 00:59:45.043
<i>because I'm Bruno
and everyone always assumes the worst, so...</i>


00:59:46.920 --> 00:59:48.297
<i>so...</i>


00:59:49.672 --> 00:59:54.552
You left to protect me?


00:59:55.762 --> 00:59:57.472
I don't know which way it'll go...


00:59:58.306 --> 00:59:59.557
but my guess...


00:59:59.724 --> 01:00:01.976
<i>the family, the encanto...</i>


01:00:02.351 --> 01:00:04.313
and the fate of the miracle itself...


01:00:05.480 --> 01:00:07.356
Well, it's all gonna come down to you.


01:00:09.985 --> 01:00:11.110
Or maybe I'm wrong.


01:00:11.277 --> 01:00:13.780
You know, it's a mystery.
That's why this vision is...


01:00:15.657 --> 01:00:19.202
Look, if I could help anymore, I would...


01:00:19.369 --> 01:00:21.413
but that's all I know.


01:00:21.746 --> 01:00:24.625
Good luck.
I wish I could've seen more.


01:00:25.918 --> 01:00:26.918
Yeah.


01:00:30.672 --> 01:00:32.132
Yeah.


01:00:32.925 --> 01:00:35.760
You wish you could have seen more,
so see more!


01:00:35.927 --> 01:00:37.887
Have another vision.


01:00:38.054 --> 01:00:40.431
No, no.
See, I don't do visions anymore.


01:00:40.599 --> 01:00:41.807
- But you could.
- But I won't.


01:00:41.974 --> 01:00:45.978
You can't say the weight of the world
is on your shoulders. The end.


01:00:46.146 --> 01:00:49.900
If our fate's up to me,
me says have another vision.


01:00:50.775 --> 01:00:52.027
Maybe it'll show me what to do.


01:00:52.193 --> 01:00:56.030
Look, even if I wanted to, which I don't,
you wrecked my vision cave.


01:00:56.197 --> 01:00:58.699
Which is a problem,
'cause I need a big open space.


01:00:58.867 --> 01:01:00.452
- We'll find one.
- Where?


01:01:00.619 --> 01:01:01.619
Use my room.


01:01:02.996 --> 01:01:05.873
The rats told me everything.
Don't eat those.


01:01:09.293 --> 01:01:14.173
Our family needs help,
and you need to get outta here.


01:01:31.023 --> 01:01:33.902
You should have told me
the second you saw the vision.


01:01:34.068 --> 01:01:35.070
Think of the family.


01:01:35.278 --> 01:01:37.280
I was thinking of my daughter.


01:01:38.155 --> 01:01:39.699
Pepa, calm down.


01:01:39.867 --> 01:01:41.117
- I'm doing my best.
- Yes.


01:01:41.284 --> 01:01:42.911
You're lucky it's not a hurricane.


01:01:43.077 --> 01:01:46.539
<i>Mamá, you've always been
too hard on Mirabel.</i>


01:01:46.706 --> 01:01:48.125
Look around.


01:01:48.291 --> 01:01:53.338
<i>We must protect our family, our e ncanto.
We cannot lose our home.</i>


01:01:55.548 --> 01:01:59.010
People in town are becoming anxious
about the magic.


01:01:59.177 --> 01:02:00.429
They want to see you.


01:02:01.137 --> 01:02:03.724
Mirabel was in that vision for a reason.


01:02:04.974 --> 01:02:06.059
Find her.


01:02:11.731 --> 01:02:13.942
We might wanna hurry.


01:02:14.108 --> 01:02:16.320
You can't hurry the future.


01:02:19.030 --> 01:02:20.990
What if I show you something worse?


01:02:21.157 --> 01:02:23.619
If I see something that you don't like,
you're gonna be all...


01:02:23.784 --> 01:02:27.664
"Bruno makes bad things happen. Oh, he's
creepy and his vision killed my goldfish."


01:02:28.248 --> 01:02:30.458
I don't think you make bad things happen.


01:02:31.251 --> 01:02:35.422
Sometimes family weirdos
just get a bad rap.


01:02:36.215 --> 01:02:37.423
You can do this.


01:02:41.135 --> 01:02:42.179
For the nerves.


01:02:46.182 --> 01:02:49.686
I can do this. I can do this,
I can do this, I can do this.


01:03:23.887 --> 01:03:25.722
You might wanna hang on.


01:03:59.840 --> 01:04:02.550
It's just the same thing.
I gotta stop!


01:04:02.717 --> 01:04:07.264
No. I need to know which way it goes.
There's gotta be an answer.


01:04:07.431 --> 01:04:08.599
Something we're not seeing!


01:04:08.764 --> 01:04:10.485
You're looking at the same thing that I am.


01:04:10.641 --> 01:04:12.242
- If there was something else...
- There!


01:04:12.351 --> 01:04:13.603
Over there!


01:04:14.396 --> 01:04:15.396
Butterfly!


01:04:15.438 --> 01:04:16.940
Follow the butterfly!


01:04:22.403 --> 01:04:23.447
Where is that?


01:04:23.864 --> 01:04:25.782
It's all out of order.


01:04:26.949 --> 01:04:30.621
It's the candle.
The candle's getting brighter!


01:04:30.829 --> 01:04:33.289
- I think you're gonna help the candle!
- How?


01:04:33.664 --> 01:04:35.333
There's someone with you.


01:04:36.710 --> 01:04:37.835
- And you fight her!
- What?


01:04:38.003 --> 01:04:39.588
Wait, no, no.
Is that a hug?


01:04:39.755 --> 01:04:40.755
Am I fighting or hugging?


01:04:41.757 --> 01:04:43.717
An embrace.
An embrace!


01:04:43.884 --> 01:04:45.885
To make the candle bright
you have to embrace her.


01:04:46.052 --> 01:04:47.346
Embrace who?


01:04:47.846 --> 01:04:48.931
Almost there.


01:04:49.097 --> 01:04:50.891
- Who is it?
- Almost there.


01:04:51.807 --> 01:04:52.809
I got it!


01:04:54.561 --> 01:04:56.103
Isabela?


01:05:01.275 --> 01:05:03.528
Your sister? That's great!


01:05:05.572 --> 01:05:06.782
Every time.


01:05:08.407 --> 01:05:11.077
Why would embracing Isabela
do anything?


01:05:11.244 --> 01:05:14.125
I don't know. Our family got a miracle.
How do you help a family miracle?


01:05:14.248 --> 01:05:15.248
You hug a sister.


01:05:15.414 --> 01:05:18.460
Mirabel?
Mirabel?


01:05:19.335 --> 01:05:21.463
Mirabel?


01:05:21.630 --> 01:05:23.590
Well, I think we're running out of time here.


01:05:23.757 --> 01:05:25.132
It's not gonna work.


01:05:25.300 --> 01:05:28.302
She won't hug me ever, okay?
She hates me!


01:05:28.469 --> 01:05:30.931
Also, I don't know if you heard,
I ruined her proposal!


01:05:31.097 --> 01:05:33.599
- Plus, P.S., she is just annoying.
- Mirabel?


01:05:33.766 --> 01:05:35.476
- Of course it's Isabela!
- Mirabel?


01:05:35.643 --> 01:05:37.003
What's her problem with me anyway?


01:05:37.144 --> 01:05:38.539
She's the one with roses
coming out of her...


01:05:38.563 --> 01:05:39.731
Mirabel!


01:05:39.898 --> 01:05:41.400
Sorry, sorry, sorry.


01:05:41.567 --> 01:05:43.402
You see, you're missing the point.


01:05:43.818 --> 01:05:46.070
The fate of the family,
it's not up to her.


01:05:46.237 --> 01:05:47.614
It's up to you.


01:05:48.155 --> 01:05:51.492
You're exactly what this family needs.


01:05:52.869 --> 01:05:54.371
You just have to see it.


01:05:55.414 --> 01:05:57.164
By yourself, after I leave.


01:05:58.250 --> 01:06:00.043
What, you're not coming?


01:06:01.210 --> 01:06:04.005
It was your vision, Mirabel. Not mine.


01:06:04.172 --> 01:06:05.590
<i>You're afraid Abuela will see you.</i>


01:06:05.757 --> 01:06:07.717
Yep. I mean, yes, that too.


01:06:09.927 --> 01:06:13.431
Hey, after you save the miracle, come visit.


01:06:14.391 --> 01:06:18.853
After I save the miracle,
I'm bringing you home.


01:06:19.980 --> 01:06:21.900
Knock, knock, knock, knock, knock.
Knock on wood.


01:06:34.327 --> 01:06:38.248
You got this.
Just gonna save the miracle.


01:06:39.166 --> 01:06:40.666
With a hug.


01:06:41.876 --> 01:06:44.670
Isa? Hey.


01:06:45.380 --> 01:06:48.425
I know we've had our issues...


01:06:48.592 --> 01:06:54.389
but I'm ready to be a better sister...
to you.


01:06:54.806 --> 01:06:57.099
So, we should just hug.


01:06:57.518 --> 01:06:59.853
Let's hug it out, huh?


01:07:00.978 --> 01:07:03.315
"Hug it out"?


01:07:04.358 --> 01:07:07.027
<i>Luisa can't lift an empanada...</i>


01:07:07.485 --> 01:07:11.405
Mariano's nose
looks like a smashed papaya!


01:07:11.949 --> 01:07:13.492
Have you lost your mind?


01:07:14.952 --> 01:07:17.954
Isa, I feel like you're upset.


01:07:18.121 --> 01:07:21.916
And you know what cures being upset?
A warm embrace.


01:07:22.416 --> 01:07:24.043
Get out.


01:07:25.420 --> 01:07:27.422
Everything was perfect.


01:07:27.588 --> 01:07:29.800
<i>Abuela was happy. The family was happy.</i>


01:07:29.967 --> 01:07:35.764
You wanna be a better sister?
Apologize for ruining my life.


01:07:39.434 --> 01:07:43.021
Go on.
Apologize.


01:07:46.567 --> 01:07:47.775
I...


01:07:49.193 --> 01:07:50.528
am...


01:07:51.697 --> 01:07:52.697
sorry...


01:07:55.157 --> 01:07:58.286
- that your life is so great!
- Out.


01:07:58.452 --> 01:08:01.164
Wait!
Fine! I apologize!


01:08:02.039 --> 01:08:04.418
I wasn't trying to ruin your life!


01:08:05.460 --> 01:08:07.880
Some of us have bigger problems...


01:08:08.045 --> 01:08:10.548
you selfish, entitled princess!


01:08:10.715 --> 01:08:11.967
"Selfish"?


01:08:12.134 --> 01:08:16.889
I've been stuck being perfect
my whole entire life!


01:08:17.055 --> 01:08:20.850
And literally, the only thing you have ever
done for me is mess things up!


01:08:21.018 --> 01:08:24.479
Nothing is messed up!
You can still marry that big dumb hunk!


01:08:24.645 --> 01:08:28.524
I never wanted to marry him!
I was doing it for the family!


01:08:30.860 --> 01:08:32.279
Oh, my gosh.


01:08:32.738 --> 01:08:33.779
Isa...


01:08:33.947 --> 01:08:37.576
that is a very serious confession.


01:08:38.868 --> 01:08:40.412
Okay, get over here.


01:08:40.578 --> 01:08:41.704
Bring it in.


01:08:42.287 --> 01:08:43.287
Isa?


01:08:46.752 --> 01:08:49.296
<i>I just made something unexpected</i>


01:08:50.380 --> 01:08:54.301
<i>Something sharp Something new</i>


01:08:54.467 --> 01:08:56.677
Isa? This is the part where we...


01:08:56.845 --> 01:09:00.681
<i>It's not symmetrical or perfect
But it's beautiful</i>


01:09:00.849 --> 01:09:04.810
<i>And it's mine
What else can I do?</i>


01:09:04.978 --> 01:09:06.354
<i>Wait Bring it in, bring it in</i>


01:09:06.563 --> 01:09:08.856
<i>-Good talk, bring it in, bring it in
-What else can I do?</i>


01:09:09.065 --> 01:09:10.775
<i>Let's hug
Bring it in, bring it in</i>


01:09:10.943 --> 01:09:12.262
<i>Free hugs
Bring it in, bring it in</i>


01:09:12.402 --> 01:09:16.113
<i>I grow rows and rows of roses</i>


01:09:16.614 --> 01:09:20.452
<i>Flor de mayo by the mile</i>


01:09:20.618 --> 01:09:24.789
<i>I make perfect, practiced poses</i>


01:09:24.957 --> 01:09:28.752
<i>So much hides behind my smile</i>


01:09:28.918 --> 01:09:34.131
<i>What could I do if I just grew
What I was feeling in the moment?</i>


01:09:34.298 --> 01:09:36.134
<i>Do you know where you're going?</i>


01:09:36.635 --> 01:09:41.222
<i>What could I do if I just knew
It didn't need to be perfect?</i>


01:09:41.390 --> 01:09:44.643
<i>It just needed to be
And they let me be</i>


01:09:44.810 --> 01:09:48.521
<i>A hurricane of jacarandás</i>


01:09:48.689 --> 01:09:51.399
<i>-Strangling figs, hanging vines
-Fig!</i>


01:09:51.899 --> 01:09:52.900
<i>This is fine</i>


01:09:53.068 --> 01:09:58.990
<i>Palma de cera fills the air
As I climb and I push through</i>


01:09:59.157 --> 01:10:01.409
<i>What else can I do?</i>


01:10:02.202 --> 01:10:05.872
<i>Can I deliver us a river of sundew?</i>


01:10:06.038 --> 01:10:09.835
<i>Careful, it's carnivorous
A little just won't do</i>


01:10:10.002 --> 01:10:13.296
<i>I wanna feel the shiver of something new</i>


01:10:13.963 --> 01:10:17.050
<i>I'm so sick of pretty
I want something true, don't you?</i>


01:10:17.216 --> 01:10:22.346
<i>You just seemed like your life's been a dream
Since the moment you opened your eyes</i>


01:10:22.514 --> 01:10:24.725
<i>How far do these roots go down?</i>


01:10:24.891 --> 01:10:28.020
<i>All I know are the blossoms you grow</i>


01:10:28.186 --> 01:10:30.689
<i>But it's awesome to see how
You rise</i>


01:10:30.855 --> 01:10:32.690
<i>- How far can I rise?
- How far can you rise?</i>


01:10:32.858 --> 01:10:36.819
<i>Through the roof to the skies
Let's go</i>


01:10:36.987 --> 01:10:40.323
<i>A hurricane of jacarandás</i>


01:10:40.489 --> 01:10:42.283
<i>-Strangling figs
-Go</i>


01:10:42.492 --> 01:10:44.869
<i>-Hanging vines
-Grow</i>


01:10:45.037 --> 01:10:50.876
<i>Palma de cera fills the air
As I climb and I push through</i>


01:10:51.042 --> 01:10:52.793
<i>What else?
What else?</i>


01:10:52.961 --> 01:10:57.548
<i>What can you do when you are
Deeply madly truly in the moment?</i>


01:10:57.716 --> 01:11:00.801
<i>Seize the moment Keep going</i>


01:11:00.969 --> 01:11:05.015
<i>What can you do when you know
Who you want to be isn't perfect?</i>


01:11:05.265 --> 01:11:08.644
<i>-But I'll still be okay
-Hey, everybody clear the way</i>


01:11:08.810 --> 01:11:12.648
<i>-I'm coming through with tabebuia
-Tabebuia</i>


01:11:12.814 --> 01:11:14.524
<i>-Making waves
-Making waves</i>


01:11:14.733 --> 01:11:17.069
<i>-Changing minds
-You've changed mine</i>


01:11:17.235 --> 01:11:19.488
<i>The way is clearer 'cause you're here</i>


01:11:19.654 --> 01:11:23.033
<i>And well, I owe this all to you</i>


01:11:23.199 --> 01:11:24.952
<i>What else can I do?</i>


01:11:25.159 --> 01:11:27.037
<i>Show them what you can do</i>


01:11:27.203 --> 01:11:30.916
<i>- What else can I do?
- There's nothing you can't do</i>


01:11:31.082 --> 01:11:34.545
<i>What else can I do?</i>


01:11:36.462 --> 01:11:38.465
You're a bad influence.


01:11:39.216 --> 01:11:41.217
What is going on?


01:11:41.844 --> 01:11:44.011
<i>Abuela? It's okay! Everything's...</i>


01:11:44.179 --> 01:11:45.889
We're gonna save the miracle.
The magic...


01:11:46.055 --> 01:11:47.515
What are you talking about?


01:11:47.682 --> 01:11:50.018
Look at our home! Look at your sister!


01:11:50.185 --> 01:11:53.229
Please just...
Isabela wasn't happy.


01:11:53.438 --> 01:11:55.565
Of course she isn't happy.
You ruined her proposal.


01:11:55.731 --> 01:11:58.025
No, no, no.
She needed me to ruin her proposal.


01:11:58.193 --> 01:11:59.694
And then we did all this!


01:11:59.862 --> 01:12:01.130
And the candle burned brighter
and the cracks...


01:12:01.154 --> 01:12:02.823
- Mirabel.
- That's why I'm in the vision!


01:12:02.989 --> 01:12:04.240
I'm saving the miracle!


01:12:04.408 --> 01:12:06.784
You have to stop, Mirabel!


01:12:09.621 --> 01:12:11.789
The cracks started with you.


01:12:12.373 --> 01:12:14.751
Bruno left because of you.


01:12:14.917 --> 01:12:18.380
Luisa's losing her powers.
Isabela's out of control.


01:12:18.546 --> 01:12:20.215
Because of you!


01:12:20.381 --> 01:12:23.135
I don't know why you weren't given a Gift...


01:12:23.301 --> 01:12:27.180
but it is not an excuse
for you to hurt this family.


01:12:37.399 --> 01:12:42.154
I will never be good enough for you.


01:12:43.197 --> 01:12:44.280
Will I?


01:12:47.158 --> 01:12:50.453
No matter how hard I try.


01:12:55.501 --> 01:12:59.671
No matter how hard any of us tries.


01:13:00.631 --> 01:13:04.009
Luisa will never be strong enough.


01:13:04.176 --> 01:13:07.220
Isabela won't be perfect enough.


01:13:07.386 --> 01:13:10.224
Bruno left our family because
you only saw the worst in him.


01:13:10.390 --> 01:13:12.434
Bruno didn't care about this family.


01:13:12.600 --> 01:13:13.976
He loves this family.


01:13:14.144 --> 01:13:17.980
I love this family.
We all love this family.


01:13:18.148 --> 01:13:19.899
You're the one that doesn't care.


01:13:20.442 --> 01:13:23.028
- You're the one breaking our home.
- Don't you ever...


01:13:23.194 --> 01:13:25.863
The miracle is dying, because of you.


01:13:31.161 --> 01:13:32.203
No, no, no!


01:13:33.956 --> 01:13:34.956
The candle!


01:13:41.880 --> 01:13:43.256
<i>Casita! Get me up there!</i>


01:13:55.853 --> 01:13:56.854
No!


01:14:03.359 --> 01:14:04.360
No!


01:14:17.164 --> 01:14:18.166
Careful, Antonio!


01:14:19.208 --> 01:14:20.460
We gotta get out of here!


01:14:20.627 --> 01:14:22.462
Mirabel! Mirabel!


01:14:23.046 --> 01:14:25.423
Mirabel, we have to get out!


01:14:36.435 --> 01:14:37.519
- Mirabel!
- Mirabel!


01:14:37.685 --> 01:14:39.104
Mirabel, leave it!


01:14:43.358 --> 01:14:46.653
Mirabel! The house is going to fall!


01:14:49.363 --> 01:14:51.783
- Mirabel, get out!
- Mirabel!


01:15:20.938 --> 01:15:21.979
No.


01:15:32.908 --> 01:15:34.201
Mirabel!


01:15:35.786 --> 01:15:38.121
Mirabel, are you hurt?


01:15:41.291 --> 01:15:42.417
Mirabel!


01:15:42.583 --> 01:15:44.043
Julieta, come quick!


01:15:44.545 --> 01:15:45.546
Julieta!


01:15:45.712 --> 01:15:48.090
Don't move.
I'll be right back.


01:15:50.259 --> 01:15:52.469
How did this happen?


01:15:52.636 --> 01:15:55.180
Here, let me help you.
Let me help you.


01:15:55.346 --> 01:15:58.182
<i>- Everyone okay?
- Antonio, don't cry, papito.</i>


01:15:58.432 --> 01:16:01.728
<i>How is this possible? The encanto's broken.</i>


01:16:01.895 --> 01:16:03.145
What do we do now?


01:16:03.354 --> 01:16:05.231
My powers. They're gone.


01:16:05.439 --> 01:16:07.484
What about Antonio?
What is he gonna do?


01:16:12.780 --> 01:16:14.615
Mirabel?


01:16:15.242 --> 01:16:17.828
Mirabel!
Where's Mirabel?


01:16:17.994 --> 01:16:19.162
Where is she?


01:16:19.328 --> 01:16:20.581
Mirabel!


01:16:21.747 --> 01:16:22.791
Mirabel?


01:16:24.501 --> 01:16:25.711
Mirabel!


01:16:37.639 --> 01:16:38.974
Mirabel?


01:16:42.476 --> 01:16:43.561
Mirabel!


01:16:45.939 --> 01:16:47.524
Mirabel!


01:16:48.108 --> 01:16:49.902
They haven't found her yet?


01:16:50.694 --> 01:16:52.695
- Mirabel!
- Mirabel!


01:16:53.322 --> 01:16:54.823
Mirabel!


01:17:13.300 --> 01:17:14.510
Mirabel.


01:17:22.225 --> 01:17:24.060
I'm sorry.


01:17:26.188 --> 01:17:28.481
I didn't want to hurt us.


01:17:29.440 --> 01:17:31.652
I just wanted...


01:17:32.444 --> 01:17:35.072
to be something I'm not.


01:17:50.002 --> 01:17:53.631
I've never been able to come back here.


01:17:56.385 --> 01:18:02.682
This river is where we were given
our miracle.


01:18:04.810 --> 01:18:07.813
<i>Where Abuelo Pedro...</i>


01:18:11.440 --> 01:18:14.569
I thought we would have a different life.


01:18:15.904 --> 01:18:19.365
I thought I would be a different woman.


01:20:46.930 --> 01:20:49.140
<i>I was given a miracle.</i>


01:20:51.350 --> 01:20:53.604
<i>A second chance.</i>


01:20:57.649 --> 01:21:00.652
<i>And I was so afraid to lose it...</i>


01:21:03.572 --> 01:21:08.368
<i>that I lost sight of who our miracle was for.</i>


01:21:11.371 --> 01:21:15.667
<i>And I am so sorry.</i>


01:21:17.543 --> 01:21:21.131
<i>You never hurt our family, Mirabel.</i>


01:21:22.673 --> 01:21:24.009
<i>We are broken...</i>


01:21:28.305 --> 01:21:30.265
because of me.


01:21:44.488 --> 01:21:46.113
<i>Abuela.</i>


01:21:47.865 --> 01:21:49.826
I can finally see.


01:21:54.163 --> 01:21:56.958
You lost your home.


01:21:58.836 --> 01:22:01.296
Lost everything.


01:22:03.131 --> 01:22:05.801
You suffered so much...


01:22:05.967 --> 01:22:07.802
all alone...


01:22:08.345 --> 01:22:11.597
so it would never happen again.


01:22:13.725 --> 01:22:17.020
We were saved because of you.


01:22:17.895 --> 01:22:21.774
We were given a miracle,
because of you.


01:22:22.693 --> 01:22:26.613
We are a family, because of you.


01:22:27.405 --> 01:22:30.533
And nothing could ever be broken


01:22:30.701 --> 01:22:34.496
that we can't fix... together.


01:22:39.542 --> 01:22:42.462
I asked my Pedro for help.


01:22:44.631 --> 01:22:46.175
Mirabel.


01:22:48.342 --> 01:22:50.470
He sent me you.


01:23:20.250 --> 01:23:22.043
She didn't do this!


01:23:23.127 --> 01:23:25.046
She didn't do this!


01:23:25.380 --> 01:23:28.591
I gave her a vision!


01:23:30.469 --> 01:23:31.470
It was me!


01:23:31.636 --> 01:23:34.014
I was, like, "Go!"
And she was, like...


01:23:34.722 --> 01:23:36.057
She only wanted to help.


01:23:36.225 --> 01:23:40.270
I don't care what you think of me,
but if you're too stubborn to...


01:23:42.064 --> 01:23:43.314
<i>Brunito.</i>


01:23:44.483 --> 01:23:48.904
I feel like I missed something important.


01:23:49.695 --> 01:23:50.988
Come on.


01:23:58.287 --> 01:24:01.332
What's happening? Where are we going?


01:24:02.792 --> 01:24:04.127
Home.


01:24:10.716 --> 01:24:12.344
It's her! I found her!


01:24:12.511 --> 01:24:13.886
I found her!


01:24:14.054 --> 01:24:16.097
She's back! She's back, she's back!


01:24:27.149 --> 01:24:28.402
Mirabel!


01:24:31.445 --> 01:24:32.655
Mirabel!


01:24:34.073 --> 01:24:35.073
<i>Mamá.</i>


01:24:36.033 --> 01:24:37.452
<i>Mi amor, I was so worried.</i>


01:24:37.618 --> 01:24:39.162
We couldn't find you.


01:24:39.579 --> 01:24:42.123
There were bees everywhere.


01:24:44.042 --> 01:24:45.293
I'll be okay.


01:24:46.670 --> 01:24:48.796
Not if we don't have a house.


01:24:48.963 --> 01:24:51.466
What? We don't have a house.
I can't say we don't have a house?


01:24:51.632 --> 01:24:53.051
What is that?
Not a house.


01:25:01.185 --> 01:25:05.564
<i>Look at this home
We need a new foundation</i>


01:25:05.730 --> 01:25:09.859
<i>It may seem hopeless
But we'll get by just fine</i>


01:25:10.027 --> 01:25:14.405
<i>Look at this family
A glowing constellation</i>


01:25:14.573 --> 01:25:19.368
<i>So full of stars
And everybody wants to shine</i>


01:25:20.621 --> 01:25:25.125
<i>But the stars don't shine, they burn</i>


01:25:25.501 --> 01:25:29.003
<i>And the constellations shift</i>


01:25:30.005 --> 01:25:34.301
<i>I think it's time you learn</i>


01:25:34.467 --> 01:25:37.720
<i>You're more than just your Gift</i>


01:25:37.887 --> 01:25:41.350
<i>And I'm sorry I held on too tight</i>


01:25:42.225 --> 01:25:46.145
<i>Just so afraid I'd lose you too</i>


01:25:46.313 --> 01:25:49.942
<i>The miracle is not
Some magic that you've got</i>


01:25:50.567 --> 01:25:51.818
<i>The miracle is you</i>


01:25:51.984 --> 01:25:54.654
<i>Not some Gift Just you</i>


01:25:54.820 --> 01:25:56.155
<i>The miracle is you</i>


01:25:56.323 --> 01:25:58.533
<i>All of you All of you</i>


01:25:58.908 --> 01:26:02.537
<i>Okay so
We gonna talk about Bruno?</i>


01:26:02.703 --> 01:26:03.913
<i>That's Bruno?</i>


01:26:04.081 --> 01:26:07.208
<i>Yeah
There's a lot to say about Bruno</i>


01:26:07.376 --> 01:26:09.376
<i>I'll start, okay
Pepa, I'm sorry about your wedding</i>


01:26:09.461 --> 01:26:10.541
<i>Didn't mean to be upsetting</i>


01:26:10.628 --> 01:26:12.606
<i>That wasn't a prophecy
I could just see you were sweating</i>


01:26:12.631 --> 01:26:14.631
<i>And I wanted you to know
That your bro loves you so</i>


01:26:14.675 --> 01:26:16.475
<i>Let it in, let it out
Let it rain, let it snow</i>


01:26:16.551 --> 01:26:17.386
<i>Let it go</i>


01:26:17.552 --> 01:26:18.912
<i>That's what I'm always saying, bro</i>


01:26:19.054 --> 01:26:20.639
<i>I got a lot of apologies I got to say</i>


01:26:20.847 --> 01:26:22.975
<i>Hey, we're just happy that you're here, okay?</i>


01:26:23.140 --> 01:26:25.020
<i>-Come into the light
-That trip was only a night</i>


01:26:25.101 --> 01:26:27.270
<i>And no matter what happens
We're gonna find our way</i>


01:26:27.436 --> 01:26:29.564
<i>Yo, I knew he never left
I heard him every day</i>


01:26:32.693 --> 01:26:34.694
<i>What's that sound?</i>


01:26:35.570 --> 01:26:37.738
<i>I think it's everyone in town</i>


01:26:39.283 --> 01:26:40.117
<i>Hey</i>


01:26:40.283 --> 01:26:44.246
<i>Lay down your load
Lay down your load</i>


01:26:44.412 --> 01:26:48.000
<i>Roll me down the road
Roll me down the road</i>


01:26:48.876 --> 01:26:52.296
<i>We have no Gifts But we are many</i>


01:26:53.046 --> 01:26:56.507
<i>And we'll do anything for you</i>


01:26:56.675 --> 01:27:01.095
<i>It's a dream when we work as a team
You're so strong</i>


01:27:01.262 --> 01:27:04.850
<i>-Yeah, but sometimes I cry
-So do I</i>


01:27:05.016 --> 01:27:07.101
<i>I may not be as strong
But I'm getting wiser</i>


01:27:07.269 --> 01:27:09.020
<i>Yeah, I need sunlight and fertilizer</i>


01:27:09.188 --> 01:27:11.689
<i>Come on
Let's plant something new and watch it fly</i>


01:27:11.856 --> 01:27:13.399
<i>Straight up to the sky</i>


01:27:13.567 --> 01:27:15.152
<i>Let's go</i>


01:27:15.319 --> 01:27:19.113
<i>The stars don't shine, they burn</i>


01:27:19.280 --> 01:27:22.909
<i>The constellations glow</i>


01:27:23.493 --> 01:27:27.038
<i>The seasons change in turn</i>


01:27:27.747 --> 01:27:30.583
<i>Would you watch our little girl go</i>


01:27:30.751 --> 01:27:33.002
<i>She takes after you</i>


01:27:34.421 --> 01:27:36.965
<i>Hey, Mariano Why so blue?</i>


01:27:38.050 --> 01:27:41.886
<i>I just have so much love inside</i>


01:27:42.887 --> 01:27:46.891
<i>You know, I've got this cousin too
Have you met Dolores?</i>


01:27:47.518 --> 01:27:49.269
Okay, I'll take it from here.
Goodbye!


01:27:49.728 --> 01:27:50.938
<i>You talk so loud</i>


01:27:51.104 --> 01:27:52.873
<i>You take care of your mother
And you make her proud</i>


01:27:52.898 --> 01:27:55.001
<i>You write your own poetry
Every night when you go to sleep</i>


01:27:55.024 --> 01:27:57.425
<i>And I'm seizing the moment
So would you wake up and notice me</i>


01:27:57.569 --> 01:27:59.820
Dolores, I see you.


01:27:59.988 --> 01:28:00.988
And I hear you.


01:28:01.030 --> 01:28:01.864
Yes!


01:28:02.032 --> 01:28:03.699
<i>All of you All of you</i>


01:28:03.867 --> 01:28:05.827
- Let's get married.
- Slow down.


01:28:05.993 --> 01:28:08.247
<i>All of you All of you</i>


01:28:09.914 --> 01:28:14.002
<i>Home sweet home
I like the new foundation</i>


01:28:14.168 --> 01:28:16.003
<i>It isn't perfect</i>


01:28:16.171 --> 01:28:18.090
<i>-Neither are we
-That's true</i>


01:28:18.256 --> 01:28:21.969
<i>Just one more thing before the celebration</i>


01:28:22.176 --> 01:28:24.220
<i>- What?
- We need a doorknob</i>


01:28:24.680 --> 01:28:26.014
We made this one for you.


01:28:37.067 --> 01:28:40.779
<i>We see how bright you burn</i>


01:28:43.782 --> 01:28:47.911
<i>We see how brave you've been</i>


01:28:50.538 --> 01:28:54.126
<i>Now see yourself in turn</i>


01:28:56.795 --> 01:28:59.506
<i>You're the real Gift, kid
Let us in</i>


01:29:00.716 --> 01:29:03.010
<i>Open your eyes</i>


01:29:08.806 --> 01:29:10.309
What do you see?


01:29:12.685 --> 01:29:15.980
I see... me.


01:29:18.692 --> 01:29:20.359
<i>All of me</i>


01:30:12.119 --> 01:30:13.372
Come on! Get in here!


01:30:29.011 --> 01:30:30.011
Yeah!


01:30:43.025 --> 01:30:44.194
<i>Yeah, amor!</i>


01:30:53.703 --> 01:30:55.454
Everyone, together...


01:30:55.622 --> 01:30:58.041
<i>La Familia Madrigal!</i>

